.SH RETURN VALUE
All functions return 0 in all cases.
Protocol errors are communicated as \f[CR]ERR\f[R] response lines, not
as return values.
.PP
Returns \-1 only on write failures (not currently implemented;
\f[CR]protocol_write_line\f[R] errors are ignored).
